[
  {
    "id": "S01-T01",
    "segment": "S01",
    "text": "开头几下声音很有分量，像船篙在岸边重重一撑。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S01-A004",
      "S01-A029"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S01-R001"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S01-T02",
    "segment": "S01",
    "text": "身体还记得陆地的坚硬，耳朵却已被送到了空处。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S01-A002",
      "S01-A003",
      "S01-A028",
      "S01-A043"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S01-R002"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S01-T03",
    "segment": "S01",
    "text": "那串声音向上扬起，又散落下来。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S01-A010",
      "S01-A033"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S01-R003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S01-T04",
    "segment": "S01",
    "text": "可以把它想成夜空里的一束烟花：升到高处，亮点散开，各自以不同的速度往下飘。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S01-A018"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S01-R004"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S01-T05",
    "segment": "S01",
    "text": "重的东西忽然变轻了，却没有马上落到一个可以站稳的地方。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S01-A006",
      "S01-A029",
      "S01-A067"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S01-R005"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S01-T06",
    "segment": "S01",
    "text": "此刻还没有熟悉的船歌摇晃来托住你。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S01-A020",
      "S01-A044",
      "S01-A053",
      "S01-A061"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S01-R006"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S01-T07",
    "segment": "S01",
    "text": "像一句重要的话开口以前，人先停了一下；并非无话可说，而是那句话还带着分量。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S01-A021",
      "S01-A022",
      "S01-A024",
      "S01-A030",
      "S01-A035",
      "S01-A036",
      "S01-A042",
      "S01-A045",
      "S01-A049"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S01-R007"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S01-T08",
    "segment": "S01",
    "text": "最先抵达的不是一片安稳的水景，是这几秒钟的悬空。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S01-A014",
      "S01-A034",
      "S01-A054"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S01-R008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T01",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "摇晃先把身体托住，歌声才慢慢浮出来。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A002",
      "S02-A010",
      "S02-A020",
      "S02-A042",
      "S02-A053"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R001"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T02",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "像两个紧挨着的人在耳语：肩膀贴着肩膀，声音放得极低，只要身边的人听见就够了。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A004",
      "S02-A007",
      "S02-A012",
      "S02-A017",
      "S02-A018",
      "S02-A025",
      "S02-A037",
      "S02-A056"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R002"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T03",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "这份亲近有温度，也有一点倦意。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A001",
      "S02-A013",
      "S02-A015",
      "S02-A048",
      "S02-A055",
      "S02-A061",
      "S02-A063"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T04",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "像夏末傍晚潮湿、温热的微风，裹在皮肤上甚至有些黏稠。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A014"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R004"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T05",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "可旋律刚往高处伸，声音反而收轻了。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A022",
      "S02-A045",
      "S02-A051",
      "S02-A052"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R005"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T06",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "千言万语涌上来，开口的第一句话却轻得像叹息。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A084"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R006"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T07",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "那种小心，很像手掌托着一件珍贵、容易碎的东西。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A005",
      "S02-A009",
      "S02-A024",
      "S02-A029",
      "S02-A033",
      "S02-A050",
      "S02-A054",
      "S02-A055"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R007"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T08",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "几个乐句回到相似的尾音，下面的水波却换了颜色。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A023",
      "S02-A078"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T09",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "同一句话轻声说过，仍想再说一遍；这次听来，安慰里已经有一点微痛。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A006",
      "S02-A023",
      "S02-A028",
      "S02-A057",
      "S02-A060",
      "S02-A070",
      "S02-A074",
      "S02-A078",
      "S02-A082"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T10",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "到后半，原本从容的呼吸渐渐收紧，感情忍不住往上涌了一次。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A030",
      "S02-A035",
      "S02-A052",
      "S02-A062",
      "S02-A064",
      "S02-A066"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T11",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "随后又轻轻呼出一口气。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A052",
      "S02-A083"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S02-T12",
    "segment": "S02",
    "text": "像两个人终于相视，听懂了一点什么，却没有急着把话说尽。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S02-A008",
      "S02-A040",
      "S02-A047",
      "S02-A061",
      "S02-A065"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S02-R012"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S03-T01",
    "segment": "S03",
    "text": "歌声的轮廓慢慢退后，流动和盘旋留了下来。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S03-A019",
      "S03-A036"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S03-R001"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S03-T02",
    "segment": "S03",
    "text": "很像亲密交谈之后，两个人忽然不再说话：沉默并不尴尬，身体还待在刚才的暖意里，心却有一点走神。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S03-A023",
      "S03-A038",
      "S03-A039",
      "S03-A042",
      "S03-A046"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S03-R002"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S03-T03",
    "segment": "S03",
    "text": "原本是想把一种感情说出来，现在只想在里面多待一会儿。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S03-A021",
      "S03-A033",
      "S03-A037",
      "S03-A040",
      "S03-A054"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S03-R003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S03-T04",
    "segment": "S03",
    "text": "水波一阵阵过去，仿佛已经到了该继续的地方，却还不愿马上动身。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S03-A019",
      "S03-A025",
      "S03-A040",
      "S03-A041",
      "S03-A053"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S03-R004"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S03-T05",
    "segment": "S03",
    "text": "这份停留里仍有细小的牵扯。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S03-A001",
      "S03-A002"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S03-R005"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S03-T06",
    "segment": "S03",
    "text": "装饰音和颤动把思绪照得很亮，又打得很碎——像被风吹碎的倒影，粼粼闪烁，却难以拼回完整的样子。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S03-A001",
      "S03-A003",
      "S03-A006",
      "S03-A048"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S03-R006"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S03-T07",
    "segment": "S03",
    "text": "于是安静里又露出一点伸手向远处够去的意思：刚才已经那么近，似乎还想听到一个更肯定的回答。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S03-A009",
      "S03-A012",
      "S03-A022",
      "S03-A024",
      "S03-A026",
      "S03-A032",
      "S03-A034"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S03-R007"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S04-T01",
    "segment": "S04",
    "text": "熟悉的歌又来了一遍，这次添了更密的花纹，更长的颤动。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S04-A009",
      "S04-A020",
      "S04-A030",
      "S04-A031"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S04-R001"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S04-T02",
    "segment": "S04",
    "text": "像一个人把同一段回忆越说越细，刚说完一处，又舍不得略过另一处。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S04-A016",
      "S04-A030",
      "S04-A034",
      "S04-A048",
      "S04-A057",
      "S04-A058",
      "S04-A061"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S04-R002"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S04-T03",
    "segment": "S04",
    "text": "声音更亮、更丰满，情意也不再肯只停在原来的分寸里。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S04-A004",
      "S04-A010",
      "S04-A015",
      "S04-A020",
      "S04-A027",
      "S04-A062",
      "S04-A069"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S04-R003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S04-T04",
    "segment": "S04",
    "text": "高处的颤音尤其像话到了喉咙口：很想把最深的情意说出来，偏偏先颤了一下。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S04-A001",
      "S04-A004",
      "S04-A007",
      "S04-A011",
      "S04-A018",
      "S04-A079"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S04-R004"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S04-T05",
    "segment": "S04",
    "text": "歌声在上方流连，底下的摇曳还推着它走。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S04-A002",
      "S04-A007"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S04-R005"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S04-T06",
    "segment": "S04",
    "text": "你能同时感觉到倾诉的热切，以及不愿仓促说完的留恋。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S04-A031",
      "S04-A032",
      "S04-A074"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S04-R006"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S04-T07",
    "segment": "S04",
    "text": "这里的繁复有一种亲昵的任性——同样的东西还想再摸一遍、再看仔细一点。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S04-A005",
      "S04-A012",
      "S04-A035",
      "S04-A038"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S04-R007"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S04-T08",
    "segment": "S04",
    "text": "到末尾，声音终于收拢下来；刚才那一长串细节，仍留着微微发颤的余温。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S04-A029"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S04-R008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S05-T01",
    "segment": "S05",
    "text": "原先一层层相伴的声音忽然撤开，剩下一条单薄的线，独自在空处蜿蜒。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S05-A011"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S05-J001"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S05-T02",
    "segment": "S05",
    "text": "船桨像停了一下，人还在水上，却一下感觉不到刚才托着自己的摇晃。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S05-A012",
      "S05-A036"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S05-J002"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S05-T03",
    "segment": "S05",
    "text": "可以把这几秒听成黄昏彻底暗下、星辰刚出现时的静。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S05-A004"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S05-J003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S05-T04",
    "segment": "S05",
    "text": "没有什么猛烈的事发生，四周却忽然空了。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S05-J004"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S05-T05",
    "segment": "S05",
    "text": "那条线没有立刻找到新的依靠。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S05-J005",
      "S05-J007"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S05-T06",
    "segment": "S05",
    "text": "它轻轻游走，慢慢摸回一点熟悉的摇曳，仿佛从空气里重新落向水面。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S05-A007",
      "S05-A036"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S05-J006",
      "S05-J007"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S06-T01",
    "segment": "S06",
    "text": "四周像换了一种光。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S06-J001"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S06-T02",
    "segment": "S06",
    "text": "歌声清澈下来，甚至会让人想起年少时第一次心动的下午：不是想清楚了某一件往事，而是忽然又碰到了那时容易被打动的自己。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S06-A004"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S06-J002"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S06-T03",
    "segment": "S06",
    "text": "可脚下的摇晃变碎了。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S06-A068"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S06-J003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S06-T04",
    "segment": "S06",
    "text": "刚在一个地方安顿，声音又向别处游移；回来了，还是待不久。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S06-J004"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S06-T05",
    "segment": "S06",
    "text": "像好不容易幻想出一个温暖的地方，赶紧搬进去，却总要起来检查门锁。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S06-A071"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S06-J005"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S06-T06",
    "segment": "S06",
    "text": "那一点坐不住没有把清澈赶走。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S06-J006",
      "S06-J008",
      "S06-J009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S06-T07",
    "segment": "S06",
    "text": "人仍想沉醉，仍舍不得离开这片亮处；只是每当以为自己可以安心待着，注意力就又被轻轻拉开。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S06-J007",
      "S06-J008",
      "S06-J009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T01",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "歌声又走过相似的地方，这次更满，伴随它的声音也更密了。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J001"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T02",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "里面像有细小的线条不断向上攀爬；一句话虽然说得仍有分寸，呼吸却已经不那么从容。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S07-A042"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J002"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T03",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "这很像深夜决定睡觉之后，脑子又开始播放白天的一段谈话。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S07-A022"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T04",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "没有新发生的事可想，却总能从另一个角度把它重新想一遍。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S07-A022"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T05",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "念头回来了，身体里的热度也跟着回来。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S07-A051"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J004"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T06",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "渐渐地，惦记的对象反而不那么清楚了。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S07-A019"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J005"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T07",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "原来是在想着某个人、某件事，现在开始沉迷于“自己正在感觉”这件事：气味、身体感觉、幻想和快感混在一起，舒服，却越来越难同它拉开距离。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S07-A028",
      "S07-A029",
      "S07-A033"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J006"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T08",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "音乐仍会收轻，又重新推起来。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J007"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T09",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "那不是一条直线上升的激动，更像温柔内部已经有了坐不住的力量。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S07-A033",
      "S07-A042"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S07-T10",
    "segment": "S07",
    "text": "你知道自己被卷进去，却暂时不想出来。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S07-A035"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S07-J009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S08-T01",
    "segment": "S08",
    "text": "这里忽然能唱得很直率。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S08-J001"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S08-T02",
    "segment": "S08",
    "text": "脚步轻快了，曲调反而显得单纯；几个乐句接着唱，像小孩一句句接龙，每次都回到一个熟悉的地方。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S08-A011",
      "S08-A063",
      "S08-A074"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S08-J002"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S08-T03",
    "segment": "S08",
    "text": "那份坦率也使人柔软。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S08-J003"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S08-T04",
    "segment": "S08",
    "text": "好像积攒许久的话终于肯说出来，不再每一句都先收住；感情露在外面，却还没有变成压倒一切的声势。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S08-A026",
      "S08-A044"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S08-J004"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S08-T05",
    "segment": "S08",
    "text": "奇妙的是，这首小歌没有稳稳结束。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S08-A074"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S08-J005",
      "S08-J008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S08-T06",
    "segment": "S08",
    "text": "临近末尾，它往高处飘去，没有落下来就散了。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S08-A073"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S08-J005",
      "S08-J008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S08-T07",
    "segment": "S08",
    "text": "像恋人刚唱到好处，忽然不唱了，看向别处。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S08-A066"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S08-J006",
      "S08-J008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S08-T08",
    "segment": "S08",
    "text": "明朗还留在耳边，低处却已经守着一个音，暂时不往前走。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S08-A072"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S08-J007",
      "S08-J008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S09-T01",
    "segment": "S09",
    "text": "起初，低处守着一个地方，上面的声音却一点一点挪动、下沉。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S09-A010",
      "S09-A029",
      "S09-A061",
      "S09-A062",
      "S09-A065"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S09-MG001",
      "S09-MG008",
      "S09-MG012"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S09-T02",
    "segment": "S09",
    "text": "刚才的歌不再继续，人像在黄昏里忽然迷了路：脚已经停住，眼前的颜色还在变。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S09-A015",
      "S09-A028",
      "S09-A029",
      "S09-A040",
      "S09-A041",
      "S09-A045",
      "S09-A046",
      "S09-A049",
      "S09-A062",
      "S09-A063"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S09-MG002",
      "S09-MG008",
      "S09-MG011",
      "S09-MG012"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S09-T03",
    "segment": "S09",
    "text": "这份等待有一点说不清的空。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S09-A041",
      "S09-A060"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S09-MG003",
      "S09-MG009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S09-T04",
    "segment": "S09",
    "text": "一个人不再说话，只在听、在等，听自己刚刚留下的那些心事。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S09-A028",
      "S09-A030",
      "S09-A036",
      "S09-A045",
      "S09-A047"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S09-MG004",
      "S09-MG009",
      "S09-MG011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S09-T05",
    "segment": "S09",
    "text": "刚才那么明朗的一句话，此刻还没有等到回答。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S09-A004",
      "S09-A019",
      "S09-A044",
      "S09-A045",
      "S09-A046",
      "S09-A049"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S09-MG005",
      "S09-MG009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S09-T06",
    "segment": "S09",
    "text": "声音像在寻找回去的路，却还没有真正松开。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S09-A026",
      "S09-A027",
      "S09-A046",
      "S09-A050"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S09-MG006",
      "S09-MG010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S09-T07",
    "segment": "S09",
    "text": "那口气仍悬在那里。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S09-A010",
      "S09-A011",
      "S09-A026",
      "S09-A027",
      "S09-A040"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S09-MG007",
      "S09-MG010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S10-T01",
    "segment": "S10",
    "text": "这里像忽然吸进一阵风，带着香气的凉意。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S10-A042",
      "S10-A074"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S10-MG001",
      "S10-MG009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S10-T02",
    "segment": "S10",
    "text": "原先紧绷的东西松开了，声音在一片共鸣里几乎不用力地游走。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S10-A001",
      "S10-A003",
      "S10-A011",
      "S10-A035",
      "S10-A039",
      "S10-A072",
      "S10-A077",
      "S10-A093",
      "S10-A095",
      "S10-A096",
      "S10-A098"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S10-MG002",
      "S10-MG009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S10-T03",
    "segment": "S10",
    "text": "可以把它听成一声长长的、还有些颤抖的深呼吸。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S10-A004",
      "S10-A039",
      "S10-A042",
      "S10-A095"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S10-MG003",
      "S10-MG010",
      "S10-MG013"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S10-T04",
    "segment": "S10",
    "text": "轻，并不等于空；眼泪和笑仿佛都容得进去，只是不必用很大的声音把它们推出去。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S10-A020",
      "S10-A031",
      "S10-A035",
      "S10-A037",
      "S10-A040",
      "S10-A053",
      "S10-A075",
      "S10-A085"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S10-MG004",
      "S10-MG010",
      "S10-MG013"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S10-T05",
    "segment": "S10",
    "text": "高处细小的音像水汽散开，刚才握得那么紧的东西，在这一刻暂时不需要握住。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S10-A005",
      "S10-A006",
      "S10-A020",
      "S10-A031",
      "S10-A032",
      "S10-A049",
      "S10-A061",
      "S10-A077"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S10-MG005",
      "S10-MG010",
      "S10-MG012"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S10-T06",
    "segment": "S10",
    "text": "动人的地方是这份敞开很安静。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S10-A031",
      "S10-A040",
      "S10-A042",
      "S10-A053",
      "S10-A075",
      "S10-A093",
      "S10-A098"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S10-MG006",
      "S10-MG011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S10-T07",
    "segment": "S10",
    "text": "它没有急着回答先前的心事，反而让人能够先呼吸。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S10-A030",
      "S10-A049",
      "S10-A056",
      "S10-A057"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S10-MG007",
      "S10-MG011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S10-T08",
    "segment": "S10",
    "text": "旋律在上面浮着，身体的分量像被一阵清新的风轻轻托起。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S10-A001",
      "S10-A005",
      "S10-A011",
      "S10-A012",
      "S10-A013",
      "S10-A022",
      "S10-A040",
      "S10-A057",
      "S10-A077",
      "S10-A096",
      "S10-A097"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S10-MG008",
      "S10-MG011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S11-T01",
    "segment": "S11",
    "text": "开头那支熟悉的歌回来了，却不再只贴着耳边说话。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S11-A003",
      "S11-A033",
      "S11-A046"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S11-MG001",
      "S11-MG009",
      "S11-MG013"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S11-T02",
    "segment": "S11",
    "text": "声音厚了，分量大了，底下的水波也翻成宽阔的涌动；原先向上伸去便收轻的地方，这次让歌声敞开。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S11-A004",
      "S11-A010",
      "S11-A020",
      "S11-A028",
      "S11-A029",
      "S11-A046"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S11-MG002",
      "S11-MG009",
      "S11-MG012"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S11-T03",
    "segment": "S11",
    "text": "像一个人终于肯把感情放在眼前，不再说到一半就退回去。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S11-A033",
      "S11-A036",
      "S11-A083"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S11-MG003",
      "S11-MG010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S11-T04",
    "segment": "S11",
    "text": "那份坚定里仍有柔软：我知道这份感情可能使我受伤，可我不想再缩回去。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S11-A036",
      "S11-A038",
      "S11-A053",
      "S11-A074"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S11-MG004",
      "S11-MG010",
      "S11-MG014"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S11-T05",
    "segment": "S11",
    "text": "你也能在这份放声里感到一点近乎痛苦的饱满。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S11-A017"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S11-MG005",
      "S11-MG011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S11-T06",
    "segment": "S11",
    "text": "歌仍认得出来，身体却像被它整个卷入了。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S11-A017",
      "S11-A079"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S11-MG006",
      "S11-MG011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S11-T07",
    "segment": "S11",
    "text": "同样的声音终于能这样唱出来，已经有很大的分量。",
    "meaning_ids": [],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S11-MG007",
      "S11-MG011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S11-T08",
    "segment": "S11",
    "text": "到段末，力量短暂悬着，话还没有真正收住。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S11-A035",
      "S11-A036",
      "S11-A051",
      "S11-A054",
      "S11-A055",
      "S11-A062"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S11-MG008",
      "S11-MG011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S12-T01",
    "segment": "S12",
    "text": "前面那首坦率的小歌，如今像被整个人唱了出来。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S12-A017",
      "S12-A035",
      "S12-A057",
      "S12-A059",
      "S12-A098",
      "S12-A104"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S12-R001",
      "S12-R008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S12-T02",
    "segment": "S12",
    "text": "声音更密、更亮，一浪又一浪往前涌，已经很难只把它当作一段好听的旋律。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S12-A022",
      "S12-A058",
      "S12-A087",
      "S12-A089",
      "S12-A098",
      "S12-A104"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S12-R002",
      "S12-R008"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S12-T03",
    "segment": "S12",
    "text": "这份强烈可以很像久别重逢时的拥抱：明明在笑，却同时想哭，身体先于语言，呼吸变深，意识有些跟不上情绪。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S12-A002",
      "S12-A006",
      "S12-A018",
      "S12-A024",
      "S12-A029",
      "S12-A030",
      "S12-A031",
      "S12-A046",
      "S12-A050",
      "S12-A055",
      "S12-A097"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S12-R003",
      "S12-R009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S12-T04",
    "segment": "S12",
    "text": "原来只是愿意袒露的心事，此刻把整个人都点燃了。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S12-A002",
      "S12-A003",
      "S12-A011",
      "S12-A017",
      "S12-A028",
      "S12-A048",
      "S12-A057",
      "S12-A059",
      "S12-A060",
      "S12-A064",
      "S12-A081",
      "S12-A095",
      "S12-A097",
      "S12-A106"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S12-R004",
      "S12-R009",
      "S12-D36"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S12-T05",
    "segment": "S12",
    "text": "但感情涌出来，并没有让里面的牵扯立刻松开。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S12-A047",
      "S12-A061",
      "S12-A069",
      "S12-A095"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S12-R005",
      "S12-R010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S12-T06",
    "segment": "S12",
    "text": "几个乐句走到末端，仍有延迟和紧张，越往前，越觉得这股明亮带着压迫。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S12-A022",
      "S12-A058",
      "S12-A061",
      "S12-A067",
      "S12-A082",
      "S12-A087"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S12-R006",
      "S12-R010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S12-T07",
    "segment": "S12",
    "text": "快乐开始有一点疼；想笑和想哭还分不开，歌也还没有把那口气完全放下。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S12-A005",
      "S12-A011",
      "S12-A018",
      "S12-A023",
      "S12-A024",
      "S12-A025",
      "S12-A031",
      "S12-A047",
      "S12-A062",
      "S12-A065",
      "S12-A067",
      "S12-A069",
      "S12-A079",
      "S12-A096",
      "S12-A097",
      "S12-A105"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S12-R007",
      "S12-R010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T01",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "刚刚有过一次很强烈的抵达，底下那股力量却仍然守在原处。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A014",
      "S13-A030",
      "S13-A032",
      "S13-A046",
      "S13-A049",
      "S13-A051",
      "S13-A055",
      "S13-A067",
      "S13-A074",
      "S13-A081"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R001",
      "S13-R011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T02",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "上面的声音一回回落下，近乎叹息；低处不肯让步，像一句重要的话已经说出口，还要再说一遍、再确认一遍。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A009",
      "S13-A014",
      "S13-A031",
      "S13-A045",
      "S13-A046",
      "S13-A049",
      "S13-A055",
      "S13-A056",
      "S13-A074",
      "S13-A075",
      "S13-A081",
      "S13-A082"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R002",
      "S13-R011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T03",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "这时的坦诚有一点无遮无挡。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A015",
      "S13-A078"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R003",
      "S13-R012"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T04",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "不是终于找到一句漂亮的话，而是连原先护着自己的分寸也藏不住了。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A015",
      "S13-A019",
      "S13-A078"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R004",
      "S13-R012"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T05",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "感情已经全在外面，说出来之后，分量却没有减轻。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A015",
      "S13-A025",
      "S13-A054",
      "S13-A057",
      "S13-A078"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R005",
      "S13-R012"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T06",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "走到后半，声音再度聚紧。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A030",
      "S13-A049",
      "S13-A051",
      "S13-A079",
      "S13-A080",
      "S13-A083",
      "S13-A084"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R006",
      "S13-R013"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T07",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "光亮里混进尖锐的摩擦，像狂欢最高点的那个人，笑着笑着，表情忽然有一点僵。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A035",
      "S13-A036",
      "S13-A039",
      "S13-A041",
      "S13-A043",
      "S13-A069",
      "S13-A070",
      "S13-A080",
      "S13-A083"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R007",
      "S13-R013"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T08",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "你仍听得见热烈，也同时感觉到它里面那根刺。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A020",
      "S13-A026",
      "S13-A031",
      "S13-A032",
      "S13-A034",
      "S13-A035",
      "S13-A036",
      "S13-A041",
      "S13-A043",
      "S13-A045",
      "S13-A070",
      "S13-A071"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R008",
      "S13-R013"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T09",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "段末那道花饰向高处伸去，再落下来。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A059"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R009",
      "S13-R014"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S13-T10",
    "segment": "S13",
    "text": "听来像话音已有了转圜，心里的那股力却还绷着。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S13-A030",
      "S13-A049",
      "S13-A054",
      "S13-A059",
      "S13-A079"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S13-R010",
      "S13-R014"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S14-T01",
    "segment": "S14",
    "text": "强烈的落点之后，声音终于轻下来。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S14-A001",
      "S14-A065"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S14-R001",
      "S14-R009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S14-T02",
    "segment": "S14",
    "text": "像黑暗中有人轻轻握了一下你的手，没有再说许多话。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S14-A002",
      "S14-A003"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S14-R002",
      "S14-R009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S14-T03",
    "segment": "S14",
    "text": "刚才的热还在，呼吸却慢慢回到身体里。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S14-A051",
      "S14-A052",
      "S14-A057"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S14-R003",
      "S14-R009"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S14-T04",
    "segment": "S14",
    "text": "低处浮起一小段歌唱，像说给自己听。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S14-A025",
      "S14-A040",
      "S14-A049",
      "S14-A072"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S14-R004",
      "S14-R010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S14-T05",
    "segment": "S14",
    "text": "高处还有细碎、轻巧的光，最后一道装饰又升起、落下。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S14-A027",
      "S14-A049",
      "S14-A060",
      "S14-A065"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S14-R005",
      "S14-R010"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S14-T06",
    "segment": "S14",
    "text": "随后，结尾忽然有了清楚的重量。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S14-A005",
      "S14-A007",
      "S14-A043"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S14-R006",
      "S14-R011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S14-T07",
    "segment": "S14",
    "text": "它没有一直往远处淡去，而是几下明确的声响，把刚才的流动收住。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S14-A005",
      "S14-A007",
      "S14-A016",
      "S14-A043",
      "S14-A060"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S14-R007",
      "S14-R011"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  },
  {
    "id": "S14-T08",
    "segment": "S14",
    "text": "可以像小船碰到岸边的木桩，船身一震，人终于踩到实地；也可以像梦骤然醒了，自己又回到寂静的房间里。",
    "meaning_ids": [
      "S14-A006",
      "S14-A008",
      "S14-A011",
      "S14-A016",
      "S14-A028",
      "S14-A032",
      "S14-A034",
      "S14-A038",
      "S14-A051",
      "S14-A057",
      "S14-A062",
      "S14-A067",
      "S14-A070",
      "S14-A073"
    ],
    "merge_ids": [
      "S14-R008",
      "S14-R011",
      "S14-D39"
    ],
    "needs_direct_review": false
  }
]